1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,431
Russian phrases. Word for word.

2
00:00:04,581 --> 00:00:06,235
«Не вешай мне лапшу на уши» (дословно) Don't hang noodles on my ears.

3
00:00:06,735 --> 00:00:07,835
Sorry, what?

4
00:00:08,135 --> 00:00:09,653
Stop pulling my leg.

5
00:00:13,253 --> 00:00:14,764
«Ни пуха ни пера» (дословно) Neither fluff nor feather.

6
00:00:15,264 --> 00:00:16,364
Sorry, what?

7
00:00:16,664 --> 00:00:17,746
Break a leg.

8
00:00:21,346 --> 00:00:22,977
«Кошки на душе скребут» (дословно) Cats are scratching at my soul.

9
00:00:23,477 --> 00:00:24,577
Sorry, what?

10
00:00:24,877 --> 00:00:26,331
I feel really down.

11
00:00:29,931 --> 00:00:31,643
«Душа в пятки ушла» (дословно) My soul went into my heels.

12
00:00:32,143 --> 00:00:33,243
Sorry, what?

13
00:00:33,543 --> 00:00:34,806
My heart sank.

14
00:00:38,406 --> 00:00:39,854
«Как с гуся вода» (дословно) Like water off a goose.

15
00:00:40,354 --> 00:00:41,454
Sorry, what?

16
00:00:41,754 --> 00:00:43,620
Like water off a duck's back.

17
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:48,783
«Семь пятниц на неделе» (дословно) Seven Fridays in a week.

18
00:00:49,283 --> 00:00:50,383
Sorry, what?

19
00:00:50,683 --> 00:00:53,145
He changes his mind every five minutes.

20
00:00:56,745 --> 00:00:58,303
«Тянуть кота за хвост» (дословно) To pull the cat by the tail.

21
00:00:58,803 --> 00:00:59,903
Sorry, what?

22
00:01:00,203 --> 00:01:01,861
Stop dragging your feet.

23
00:01:03,861 --> 00:01:06,135
How many did you know? Tell me in the comments.
